WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.198
Everything happened quickly for the Barth family.

2
00:00:03.199 --> 00:00:05.886
Dad had found a good job in the city.

3
00:00:05.887 --> 00:00:09.434
So they had to move back immediately.

4
00:00:09.435 --> 00:00:12.748
The children got up early the next morning.

5
00:00:12.749 --> 00:00:15.709
They visited their neighbors with the homemade cookies.

6
00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:17.841
They wanted to say thank you.

7
00:00:17.842 --> 00:00:20.688
And they wanted to say good-bye.

8
00:00:20.689 --> 00:00:25.548
"These cookies are for you," the children said to the Jenkins.

9
00:00:25.549 --> 00:00:28.430
Then Cy and Jane visited Mr. Keefer.

10
00:00:28.431 --> 00:00:32.175
Panther and Bobby went to see Mr. Becker and Silver.

11
00:00:32.176 --> 00:00:36.679
It was not easy to say good-bye to their new friends.

12
00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:40.487
When they got home, Dad was already loading the car.

13
00:00:40.488 --> 00:00:43.478
"Hurry and pack, kids," he called to them.

14
00:00:43.479 --> 00:00:45.610
"We don't have a lot of time."

15
00:00:45.611 --> 00:00:48.842
The children stared at the boxes beside the car.

16
00:00:48.843 --> 00:00:51.209
Suddenly Panther gasped.

17
00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:55.636
"We didn't say good-bye to Huey!" she whispered.

18
00:00:55.637 --> 00:00:58.879
The children began running toward the woods.

19
00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:01.750
"Where are you going?" Dad shouted.

20
00:01:01.751 --> 00:01:05.637
"To say good-bye to a friend!" Cy yelled back.

21
00:01:05.638 --> 00:01:09.278
The children did not stop until they got to Huey's well.

22
00:01:09.279 --> 00:01:12.503
Cy hurriedly lowered the bucket down.

23
00:01:12.504 --> 00:01:15.735
Once again, he struggled to find Huey's shell.

24
00:01:15.736 --> 00:01:17.850
Finally he pulled Huey up.

25
00:01:17.851 --> 00:01:21.656
As he had the day before, Huey seemed different.

26
00:01:21.657 --> 00:01:23.862
He even smiled at the children.

27
00:01:23.863 --> 00:01:28.074
"Did you come to make your last wish?" he said.

28
00:01:28.075 --> 00:01:33.152
"Last wish? Are you going somewhere?" asked Panther.

29
00:01:33.153 --> 00:01:36.561
"I thought you were leaving," Huey said.

30
00:01:36.562 --> 00:01:39.878
"How did you know?" asked Bobby.

31
00:01:39.879 --> 00:01:46.556
Huey smiled again and said, "We Orlanes know what we need to know."

32
00:01:46.557 --> 00:01:53.356
"Huey," Panther said, her voice choking, "we're going to miss you."

33
00:01:53.357 --> 00:01:55.716
The others nodded sadly.

34
00:01:55.717 --> 00:02:01.060
"Thank you for making our wishes come true," Cy said gratefully.

35
00:02:01.061 --> 00:02:07.271
"We're sorry but we don't have anything to give you," Jane cried.

36
00:02:07.272 --> 00:02:10.775
"We baked some cookies," said Bobby.

37
00:02:10.776 --> 00:02:13.371
"But we gave them all away."

38
00:02:13.372 --> 00:02:16.595
"Cookies?" Huey made a face.

39
00:02:16.596 --> 00:02:20.386
"I'm glad you didn't give them to me.

40
00:02:20.387 --> 00:02:22.831
I don't like human food."

41
00:02:22.832 --> 00:02:26.027
Then he looked at each child more gently.

42
00:02:26.028 --> 00:02:30.424
"But thank you for thinking of me."

43
00:02:30.425 --> 00:02:35.024
"Can we come to visit you sometime?" Jane asked hopefully.

44
00:02:35.025 --> 00:02:39.598
"I'm afraid not," said Huey, shaking his head.

45
00:02:39.599 --> 00:02:42.501
"For I, too, am leaving."

46
00:02:42.502 --> 00:02:46.975
"Leaving?" cried the children. "Where?"

47
00:02:46.976 --> 00:02:51.258
"To my next destination," Huey replied.

48
00:02:51.259 --> 00:02:53.379
"How can we find you?"

49
00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:57.853
Jane cried, not caring that tears were falling down her face.

50
00:02:57.854 --> 00:03:00.974
Huey's fins began to open and close.

51
00:03:00.975 --> 00:03:03.965
His head moved from side to side.

52
00:03:03.966 --> 00:03:07.810
Then his whole body glowed brightly.

53
00:03:07.811 --> 00:03:13.537
"One day," he said, "you may come across another well.

54
00:03:13.538 --> 00:03:18.320
Look inside and perhaps I may be there.

55
00:03:18.321 --> 00:03:23.358
But," he continued, "search deeper in your hearts.

56
00:03:23.359 --> 00:03:26.808
And you will find me for sure."

57
00:03:26.809 --> 00:03:32.268
"We're going to miss you, Huey," the children said, weeping.

58
00:03:32.269 --> 00:03:35.045
They stood there in tears for a few minutes.

59
00:03:35.046 --> 00:03:37.551
Nobody said a word.

60
00:03:37.552 --> 00:03:41.065
Finally, Cy spoke up.

61
00:03:41.066 --> 00:03:45.771
"I think we have to go," he said, sniffling.

62
00:03:45.772 --> 00:03:50.874
"Just don't forget to lower me back down," Huey said.

63
00:03:50.875 --> 00:03:53.760
Cy lovingly lifted Huey's shell.

64
00:03:53.761 --> 00:03:56.955
He gently placed it inside the bucket.

65
00:03:56.956 --> 00:04:03.107
"Good-bye, Cy! Panther! Bobby and Jane!" Huey waved.

66
00:04:03.108 --> 00:04:07.187
"Good-bye, Huey!" cried the children.

67
00:04:07.188 --> 00:04:11.631
Then for the last time Cy lowered the bucket down the well.

68
00:04:11.632 --> 00:04:16.438
The children watched as Huey's shell disappeared down the dark hole.

69
00:04:16.439 --> 00:04:18.303
"I have one last wish,"

70
00:04:18.304 --> 00:04:21.882
said Panther, as the children turned to go home.

71
00:04:21.883 --> 00:04:24.889
"But Huey's gone," said Cy.

72
00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:27.378
"It doesn't matter," she answered.

73
00:04:27.379 --> 00:04:30.017
"What is it?" asked Jane.

74
00:04:30.018 --> 00:04:32.401
"I wish the best for Huey.

75
00:04:32.402 --> 00:04:37.377
I wish he finds happiness wherever he goes," Panther said.

76
00:04:37.378 --> 00:04:41.187
"How do you know it will come true?" asked Jane.

77
00:04:41.188 --> 00:04:47.424
"Because the best wishes in life are those you make for others," replied Panther.

78
00:04:47.425 --> 00:04:55.760
Hand in hand, the Barth children walked out of the woods.

